# work — project registry.   Columns:   slug   absolute-path   [layout]
#
# `work <slug>` opens (or attaches) a zellij session named <slug>, rooted at the path,
# using the named layout in ~/.config/zellij/layouts/ (defaults to "project").
# Anything NOT listed here is still reachable by name/dir via zoxide in the `work` picker.
# Slugs must be [A-Za-z0-9_-].  Edit this file with:  work edit
#
# Copy this file to `projects` and replace the rows with your own. The real
# registry is gitignored, because it names your machine's paths and projects.
#
# slug            path                                            layout

hq                $HOME/dev                                       hq
web-app           $HOME/dev/web-app                               project
api               $HOME/dev/api                                   project
notes             $HOME/notes                                     project
